, "price": 3000}, {"name": "Flower Ring", "price": 10000}]} itemTitle="Item Shop" equipmentTitle="Equipment Shop" />
      <p>With those obstacles cleared, you can enter the city.  First, head east to make the recommended purchases listed above.  Then, I'd strongly recommend scouring the city for every last soldier you can find and kill.  They come in large groups and give great experience.</p>
      <p>Besides Stocke and Eruca, use whoever you want in the third slot, as Eruca can one-shot almost anything with her Burst Light.  For BIG enemies, you may want to launch them with Air Assault or Cross Star first.  I would try to keep my levels pretty even between the others, though keeping Aht a couple levels ahead of the others is good, since she learns her final spells two levels after them.</p>
      <p>When you're ready, rest up at the inn, and walk right in the front gate of the castle.  Balsy.  Just walk straight up to the throne room to help Eruca claim her destiny.</p>
      <BossCard name="Heavy Granorgite x2, Protea Guards x2" weakness="Lightning, None">
        <p><strong>Strategy:</strong> You don't even need buffs for this fight, it's so easy.  Have Aht lay a Volt Star trap in the lower left corner.  Then, use Push Assault and Left Assault on the two Granorgites to kill them quickly.  The blue Protea Guard may lay down a Heal Zone, which may slow things down, so kill her next.  Use any Star trap and Assaults twice to take down each Guard, one by one.</p>
      </BossCard>
      <p>For defeating them, you will have completed your business in Standard History. Now, it is time to return to the "A New Alliance" node in Alternate History.</p>
      <Callout type="note" title="Recommended Equipment">
        <p>Recommended Equipment at this point in the game<br/>
        <strong>Stocke:</strong> Pieti Edge, Moirae Manteau, Crystal Charm x3<br/>
        <strong>Raynie:</strong> Witch Spear, Sable Larme, Crystal Charm x3<br/>
        <strong>Marco:</strong> Gaia Blade, Tungsten Mail, Bishop Stud x3<br/>
        <strong>Aht:</strong> Promised Knife, Life Robe, Bishop Stud x3<br/>
        <strong>Eruca:</strong> FMJ Rounds, Jeweled Gown, Crystal Charm x3<br/>
        <strong>Extra:</strong> Titanium Lance, Alloy Gauntlet, Gospel Armor, Alloy Plate, Beast Charm,<br/>
        5 Iron Charms</p>
      </Callout>
    </div>
  </ChapterCard>

